     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "In, on and during",
     "texto": [
      "**在……上** can indicate a surface (**在桌子上**, «on the table») or a field (**在学习上**, «in studies»). **在……中** usually means «inside» or «during»; **在……下** can indicate a lower position or conditions.",
      "In English «in» or «on» often does the job; in Chinese, 上, 中 and 下 make the relationship explicit."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
